Provenance
----------
This is a clean-room, independent implementation. It was written from public
documentation, published standards, open-source libraries under permissive
licenses, and observation of a third-party application's externally observable
behaviour. No source code, markup, imagery, icon artwork, font binary, sound or
distinctive user-interface string from any other product is included in this
repository or in distributed builds.

No endorsement by, sponsorship from, or affiliation with any vendor is claimed
or implied. Product names of other software appear in documentation only, to
describe file formats and workflows that this project is compatible with.

Third-party dependencies
------------------------
Every runtime and build dependency, with its licence and upstream URL, is
listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Bundled artwork and fonts, with author,
source and licence, are listed in ATTRIBUTION.md.

The reference analysis material (a third-party desktop build) is NOT part of
this repository, is never redistributed, and is excluded by .gitignore. Only
derived, original interface notes and evidence identifiers are committed.